    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d406-a1-a16">

                <pb facs="0659" n="589" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg589"/>

                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#center">[Enclosure No. 20.—Telegram from
                            <placeName>Queretaro</placeName> to San Luis Potosi, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1867-06-14">June 14, 1867</date>, 49 minutes
                        past 8 o’clock, evening.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister of Relatlons:</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Yesterday, at 8 in the morning, the council of war opened, and up to this moment,
                    half past 7, has not finished its labors. I think that within two hours, at the
                    furthest, I shall be able to communicate the result.</p>
                <p>To-day I have sent from this city the Princess of Salm and various foreigners,
                    because they were at work very recklessly, and their labors were very
                    dangerous.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ESCOBEDO.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
